{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Clear MDC when restoration fails.** An ordinary exception from the restoration close path is ignored in favor of the selected invocation outcome, but the pooled worker can retain plugin or trace MDC and expose it to later work. Attempt a guarded `MDC.clear()` fallback before completing the selected result, and do not silently reuse the worker if cleanup cannot be established; cover this with a reused-worker test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77yjZ1","finding_digest":"51b3110768aa57a025405e5f29773d4785c5995e5de3fc606cd430926b507f01","finding_id":"arf_v1_kgzrcb3ivjl2ajkalzpss5z5i6","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::inline-mdc-restoration-leak","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::inline-mdc-restoration-leak","line":321,"observation_digest":"88c50547723ffdc758efff19e74f9ef09bf88afa3ce5deafb54973952a93b1b2","observation_id":"aro_v1_rdcqkr3sh764owhp74m6ot466c","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_kgzrcb3ivjl2ajkalzpss5z5i6","published_at":"2026-10-08T21:30:04Z","review_id":"arr_v1_povxmdcloccfgct74pwuugcyxz","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"18d4e3c9937570ae7a3618bb4830be440021e816","reviewer":"codex","start_line":317,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_7trrtkwdslt3lwlvja3aolg66t","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T21:30:04Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
